<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-HK">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MCL Cinema - 香港首選電影院線</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='cinema.css') }}">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background-color: #0a0a0a;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3c72 0%, #2a5298 100%);
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #2a5298;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #e50914;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e50914, #ff6b6b);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .movie-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .movie-card {
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .movie-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-15px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 20px rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.4);
        }

        .movie-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 420px;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .movie-card:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .movie-info {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .movie-info h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .movie-meta {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #aaa;
        }

        .movie-meta span {
            background-color: #2a2a2a;
            padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .movie-info p {
            color: #cccccc;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e50914, #b20710);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.3);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff1a24, #e50914);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.5);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #0a0a0a;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
            border-top: 2px solid #2a5298;
        }

        footer p {
            color: #888;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .movie-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
            }

            header h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            h2 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>🎬 MCL Cinema</h1>
        <p>香港首選電影院線 - 極致觀影體驗</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="{{ url_for('cinema_index') }}">首頁</a>
        <a href="{{ url_for('cinema_index') }}">現正熱映</a>
        <a href="{{ url_for('cinema_coming_soon') }}">即將上映</a>
        <a href="{{ url_for('index') }}">返回主站</a>
    </nav>
    
    <main>
        <h2>🔥 現正熱映</h2>
        <div class="movie-grid">
            {% for movie in movies %}
            <div class="movie-card">
                <img src="{{ movie.poster }}" alt="{{ movie.title }}" onerror="this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/300x450?text=MCL+Cinema'">
                <div class="movie-info">
                    <h3>{{ movie.title }}</h3>
                    <div class="movie-meta">
                        <span>⏱️ {{ movie.duration }}</span>
                        <span>📊 {{ movie.rating }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <p style="color: #e50914; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">{{ movie.genre }}</p>
                    <p>{{ movie.description }}</p>
                    <a href="{{ url_for('cinema_movie', movie_id=movie.id) }}" class="btn">🎟️ 立即購票</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </main>
    
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 MCL Cinema. All rights reserved. | 香港首選電影院線</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">客戶服務熱線: 2317 6666</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
